WEBVTT

NOTE
Audio description for disc01_08h.avi
Scene: Balamb Garden lifts off
Estimated duration: 27 seconds
No dialogue in this scene

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Balamb Garden begins its historic transformation. The hidden hover mechanisms beneath the massive facility activate simultaneously.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The entire Garden structure shakes violently. Deep mechanical rumbling echoes from below. The ground surrounding the Garden cracks and splits outward in expanding fissures.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Water and soil spray upward as the Garden tears free from its foundations with tremendous force. The enormous ring-shaped structure begins to rise.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Slowly, the massive facility lifts into the air. A crater is left behind where the Garden once sat. The hover mechanisms glow and hum with energy.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Students inside the Garden are thrown about by the violent movement. They stumble and grab onto walls and railings to steady themselves.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
The Garden drifts higher above the crater, now suspended in the air. The ring-shaped silhouette is immense against the sky.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Balamb Garden is now a mobile fortress, floating freely above the ground, no longer anchored to any location.
